<div class="unsub-wrapper">
  <div class="unsub-panel">
    <h1 class="unsub-title">That link didn't work</h1>

    <p class="unsub-body">
      This unsubscribe link is malformed or incomplete — most often because a mail
      client wrapped it across two lines and only part of it came through.
    </p>

    <p class="unsub-aside">
      Try copying the whole link out of the email, or write to
      <a href="mailto:streetscissors@gmail.com">streetscissors@gmail.com</a>
      and you'll be taken off by hand.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
